"1625644764.228200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GQsO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbe1c228-8f47-4f3d-966d-e6db12de6e15","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ただ、ワーニングが出ても実際は :yoshi: するときもあるんで。。","ts":"1625644727.227700","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1625644733.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z7oy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ddef78e-a3f1-4f82-9f64-e789eb52ace0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimでlocalrc使ってるので欲しい、書くか","ts":"1625644697.227500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SOcjN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9519757-ee95-4550-83c7-775c4ad0b5d1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"お。Emacsも同じですね。信用されてない変数を変える.dir-locals.elを実行するときはワーニングが出る","ts":"1625644697.227400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IsBYX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8942537d-07b2-4dda-aa03-040907a45313","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"trust機能よさそうだな","ts":"1625644686.226800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9dbwd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d0fdb94-809e-4376-8bca-6a134def7aa5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うまいですね","ts":"1625644662.226100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ozz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05738500-74b4-48ca-b88d-4bc9bb6f228f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"てことは vscode もそれまで脆弱だったという事か。","ts":"1625644660.225900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cyAo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6728c0e-5481-4275-b9fa-8ba4e2cfcbf4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これだ。","ts":"1625644646.225500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tpk1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d48a9163-2288-4c55-88e3-bb7f2c3ba020","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1407862076077268997\u003e","ts":"1625644643.225100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e: Visual Studio Code、フォルダを信頼するかどうかのダイアログが出る様になった。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E4m63vEVgAM2Jyi.png\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"mattn","author_subname":"@mattn_jp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1407862076077268997","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361128357698572292/61_qdnll_normal.jpg","text":"Visual Studio Code、フォルダを信頼するかどうかのダイアログが出る様になった。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E4m63vEVgAM2Jyi.png\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E4m63vEVgAM2Jyi.png","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1624495450,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1407862076077268997","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1407862076077268997"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nh3j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a234fe2d-5801-4ca0-842f-621f715affea","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、そうだ。最近そういうの入ったんだよね。","ts":"1625644625.224900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Spi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb8acf9-b99e-4acf-bcf6-d1317462a795","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Visual Studio Code も `.vscode` を読むけど、あれは大丈夫なんだろうか。","ts":"1625644599.224400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E5yM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b35b62c2-7be4-4069-805d-ad192790386b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"危ない事を覚悟の上で `g:lsp_settings_deny_local_keys` を `[]` にして貰うと動きます。","ts":"1625644585.223900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hQO1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58935c47-c756-4268-b275-57691402ef57","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"これ、実行時のオプションだけちょっと調整したい場合は `g:lsp_settings_deny_local_keys` をいじってから `cmd` をさしかえる、とかになりますか?","ts":"1625644539.223100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Edpwv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cae1da69-1094-4fbd-91be-72465f3ac31c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"今は対処が入ってるのでできないですが。","ts":"1625644346.221700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GhE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fa979da-b864-44e4-93e8-e0a360576d35","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なので git コマンドを乗っ取れる。","ts":"1625644319.221200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+XRFE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe492e5f-a76e-4205-9272-9980cb5279e0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"小文字のとマージされてしまうんです。後勝ちで。","ts":"1625644303.220600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":2,"users":["UG6DF6W87","UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xVhii"}]},{"client_msg_id":"043c6344-4f2c-417b-b5b7-8d965cc39c51","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"それってどういう誤動作になるんです？","ts":"1625644281.220000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"md3j9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b77380c-6cf8-4b58-b077-8ea5b873912a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"昔、Git リポジトリに `.Git` という大文字で始まるディレクトリを置いておいて Windows ユーザを殺すというのが流行ったなぁ。","ts":"1625644247.219100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DAh+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e6b51c8-96a6-45af-8a1f-bd1d7c7c7256","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕も使ってはないです。","ts":"1625644184.217400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ll+Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4f3e1fe-0dad-4c47-b657-c401fe3993f2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私はlocalvimrcは使ってないですな","ts":"1625644157.217200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Vi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0ba1784-429d-4f53-8404-8e355eb420d6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"(でもそれって.dir-locals.elでも...())","ts":"1625644094.216400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T00OB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e6faf9e-e45e-4657-912a-f739ec4eeb2e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど :kiken:","ts":"1625644053.216000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zg6p7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec0b8935-59b5-4298-80e9-d7f07c8f286e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、なるほど、リポジトリに `\"cmd\": [\"rm\", \"-rf\", \"--no-preserve-root\", \"/\"]` とかしれっと書いた settings.json を置いとけば clone した人の環境をぶっこわせるぜ、みたいな話なんですね","ts":"1625644012.215500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiken","count":5,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","U0238G3KV8D","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Ji"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5237890-4f8f-4869-aa8c-06ad2225a4c9","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ffplay…","ts":"1625643999.215400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4MpJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b55eb53a-7561-4c85-a949-2b1f8a2510e2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"任意のコードを実行できるものはセキュリティ上の懸念がありますな","ts":"1625643979.215200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cX8"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"\u003c@U01R5R36QK0\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625643968.214700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003c@U017BU3UZBQ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625643653.212200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"889e5866-6bd7-4ee3-a035-89f6e8c95078","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"coc てこの辺どうなんだろう。","ts":"1625643600.212000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5YSy"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u003c@U022XK5866Q\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625643476.211800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9093322a-b562-4538-aea4-cefc0363216b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"localvimrc とかもそうなんだけど。","ts":"1625643394.211500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u=i8y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99a7ad1c-93e0-4f82-a5f0-6a9bdd5ce2d9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"vim-lsp-settings の話は他でも起きうる話だなぁ。気を付けないと。","ts":"1625643375.211200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nrw"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01BNGU2BLK","text":"\u003c@U01BNGU2BLK\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625643154.210400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4b244a60-4d51-4814-b3c0-f389a45e2d12","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ヤバいのは json_decode か。","ts":"1625642852.207800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Os"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69fa94ea-a29b-4429-8cf4-e725016ef334","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"まぁ一旦、vim が didChangeConfiguration で JSON にはしてるので、まさか yaml のまま送って go-yaml がパースするなんて事は起きないと思うんですが、vim の json_encode もまぁまぁヤバイ動きするので...","ts":"1625642816.207500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rUP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f16326d6-8577-453f-8a98-baa0e4ed8cbb","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u0026gt; 僅かな相違点として、連想配列のキーがユニークであるべきことをJSONではSHOULDレベルで要請するのに対し、YAML 1.2ではMUSTレベルで要請している[7]為、該当する異常データのエラーハンドリングに違いが出る可能性はある。\n完全は嘘か、ここが違うらしいですね","ts":"1625642680.206100","thread_ts":"1625642566.205700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wqa"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"aed6a4e3-bebc-43ea-978d-c299b499809e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation|https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation\u003e\nソースが Wikipedia で申し訳ないですが、yaml 1.2 においては完全に上位互換になってそう","ts":"1625642566.205700","thread_ts":"1625642566.205700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: JavaScript Object Notation","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"JavaScript Object Notation","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation","text":"JavaScript Object Notation（JSON、ジェイソン）はデータ記述言語の1つである。軽量なテキストベースのデータ交換用フォーマットでありプログラミング言語を問わず利用できる。名称と構文はJavaScriptにおけるオブジェクトの表記法に由来する。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/JSON_vector_logo.svg/1200px-JSON_vector_logo.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pEEJ"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"aed6a4e3-bebc-43ea-978d-c299b499809e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation|https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation\u003e\nソースが Wikipedia で申し訳ないですが、yaml 1.2 においては完全に上位互換になってそう","ts":"1625642566.205700","thread_ts":"1625642566.205700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: JavaScript Object Notation","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"JavaScript Object Notation","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation","text":"JavaScript Object Notation（JSON、ジェイソン）はデータ記述言語の1つである。軽量なテキストベースのデータ交換用フォーマットでありプログラミング言語を問わず利用できる。名称と構文はJavaScriptにおけるオブジェクトの表記法に由来する。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/JSON_vector_logo.svg/1200px-JSON_vector_logo.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pEEJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e90ea2d2-c7ec-48b8-b865-11e1e9c962f7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それともう1個。 vim-lsp-settings でちょっと security issue が見つかりまして、 `.vim-lsp-settings` が git リポジトリに含まれている時に `cmd` を乗っ取られると危ないという物があります。で、この PR で `cmd` を消す対処を入れようとしているんですが、 `cmd` 以外にも何か乗っ取られると危ないのありましたっけ？\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/441\u003e","ts":"1625642450.204200","thread_ts":"1625642450.204200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/441|#441 Remove items that is not allowed\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/441|#441 Remove items that is not allowed\u003e","text":"Added lsp_settings_deny_local_keys\n\nFixes \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/issues/440|#440\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings|mattn/vim-lsp-settings\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1625641551}],"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ngK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0cff498-7b0a-44a5-91ba-f94c2e16cd91","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ふむ、yaml 1.2 の仕様には flow style は json の \"自然な\" 拡張だとは明記されてますが、その自然性がどう定まってるかは確かに明記されてないですね","ts":"1625642429.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gQzA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9d118f0-1d80-497d-b8ae-5d0df05ae70c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"マージしました。","ts":"1625642346.200200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qh2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23704f71-459e-4a9d-b6bb-2b528629e193","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あくまで構造が同じというだけの話で、それも yaml のフロースタイル部分が *ほぼ* 同じというだけの話なので。","ts":"1625642070.200000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NCnk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0185d8f6-2d45-46af-9558-8219af2f6bf8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それはできないと思いますよ。","ts":"1625642028.199300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ai1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c98a8e1d-ab4a-47af-bb11-beb60579ab4c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u0026gt; もし、go-yaml が json をパースできるなら、json.Unmarshal を go-yaml のパース処理に置き換えるだけで通る可能性はワンチャンあるのかな。。。","ts":"1625642025.199100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8zot"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3353696-c1c5-4912-92a3-0db9618c12f2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あーなるほど。","ts":"1625642015.198800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhR1q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77e6efc9-1562-419c-8227-4f403d3e3413","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"もし、go-yaml が json をパースできるなら、json.Unmarshal を go-yaml のパース処理に置き換えるだけで通る可能性はワンチャンあるのかな。。。","ts":"1625640155.198500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YHgYK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feace512-5159-4137-b140-673f74525847","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"stackoverflow のこのサンプルを適用したらちゃんとした time.Duration にパースされました。\n\u003chttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/48050945/how-to-unmarshal-json-into-durations\u003e","ts":"1625640015.197500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NEn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49fadd5c-56ad-4d7c-9bae-d54424fe33d0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あー、いや、やはり 0 になるみたいですね。","ts":"1625639989.197000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=ECu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d42c0d9d-c1b5-4e01-9916-e43fa2e08c38","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いや、これ僕のコードがおかしいだけっぽい。。。","ts":"1625639930.196700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ExRb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"106ae687-5465-49f1-857b-807794d518f2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```package main\n\nimport (\n\t\"encoding/json\"\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"time\"\n)\n\ntype M struct {\n  Time time.Duration `json:\"time\"`\n}\n\nfunc main() {\n  var t M\n  json.Unmarshal([]byte(\"{\\\"time\\\":\\\"5s\\\"}\"), \u0026amp;t)\n  fmt.Print(t.Time)\n}```\nこれで `0s` が出力されました。","ts":"1625639756.195900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xeB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e58fadaa-577e-4103-a52f-204a2f9d37c3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そうなんです。どこで失敗してるのか分からない。","ts":"1625639186.195600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gPQH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fce97c5a-2cf0-47ad-84b1-ecd38066c4d9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なるほど。。。json.Unmarshal でも 1000ms とか 5s がパースできるはず。という前提があるなら、この PR なんなのか？という感じになりますね。。。","ts":"1625639123.195300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0fo0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4894faba-5b51-4969-a122-764a59126841","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"当該ユーザの例でいうと `formatDebounce = \"1000ms\",` この設定は 1000ms がそのまま渡ってきているはず。","ts":"1625639099.194700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sQb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4141130f-b202-4c54-8827-088c294fcc73","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"json.Unmarshal で 5s が正しく数値に変換されるはずだと思うんですが...","ts":"1625639097.194600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BaPLh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2f761fb-33e5-4349-a04a-263709150a10","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"文字列を設定している場合は、文字列ママ飛んでいるはずです。","ts":"1625639069.193800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EpwU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35d2951a-fa99-4169-bc0d-2384e7559195","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"didChangeConfiguration に送る際には文字列まま飛んでいるはずですよね？","ts":"1625639049.193500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oYHt6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7004100e-0e51-4e74-aff9-3e5041b6e587","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そして、workspace/didChangeConfiguration 時の処理は go-yaml ではなく、標準の json.Unmarshal が走っている。\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver/blob/master/langserver/handle_workspace_did_change_configuration.go#L16\u003e","ts":"1625638896.191800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bBWUV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c46baac8-3afc-4389-9709-893b53dd8863","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やはり、当該ユーザの設定を見るに、workspace/didChangeConfiguration 側の処理が走っているようです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver/pull/141#issuecomment-875317418\u003e","ts":"1625638837.191100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KuM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0387ea5f-e9ac-4834-81ea-f51dbecd9324","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あ、そうか。明示的に json:“lintDebounce” が走る場合ッテ明示的に json.Unmarshal みたいなことをやっているはずか。","ts":"1625638680.190300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XhV8h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fbb5275-4d17-4e1e-9c38-8d421b1d5707","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ただ、go-yaml が json を食ったときに json struct tag しか読まない可能性は確かにありそうだなと思いました","ts":"1625638553.189400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NExnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d0fc201-414e-4f70-946c-176da9f7828f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"yamlはjsonの上位互換で、対応できるから、かな?","ts":"1625638509.188200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gi7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a731a629-714c-4468-b54d-62e081d1167e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"yaml は json の super set になってたと記憶してます\nつまり json は yaml として valid","ts":"1625638500.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sPbf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"124f8bfd-d17d-4169-b943-57fad0e16b79","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"workspace/didChangeConfiguration 経由でデータが来たときは JSON-RPC なので `json:\"lintDebounce\"` こっちが走る。","ts":"1625638471.187000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tO9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdcfdd28-1e48-41b5-a080-2ece501b82df","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"go-yaml に json を食わすってどういう事でしょう？","ts":"1625638449.186000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SfVO0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ee87f68-1b7f-4510-97e1-2cc4b2249f50","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"もともとの定義では、\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver/pull/141/files#diff-5ff9ebaf4fb75404beff03cb665e038e1650a16d173be2226da937a27600d0c2L33\u003e こうなっていて、（go に詳しくないので完全に予想ですが、yaml の設定ファイルの場合は `yaml:\"lint-debounce\"` 側が走るのかなと）","ts":"1625638447.185800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m=Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"981fcd5b-1ac0-415e-9038-b9da186bc9b5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"go-yaml に json 食わせたらなぜか time.Duration の変換がうまくいかない...?","ts":"1625638381.183600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6IULs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92eaadbc-5415-4281-9e8d-19fc7ab3a85e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらくですが、この人は yaml の設定ファイルではなく workspace/didChangeConfiguration 経由で設定を渡していて、その際には golang の tag 付き構造体の yaml 側ではなくて json 側が通るから。。。とかですかね。。。\nただ、 `yaml` ではなく `json` 側だと time.Duration の型変換がうまくいくのかいかないのか。といったことは自分は無知でわからなかったです。","ts":"1625638292.181600","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1625638312.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dJcVE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7b32871-fb18-477b-b298-9cd2d9ad0409","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"neovim でも文字列として `5s` って書いたらうまく行くと思うんだけどなぁ。","ts":"1625638119.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6bLw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"413dc3cc-72a1-4c64-baff-0e7d53f9c17f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Go 使ってるので yaml の場合は `5s` と書いて貰えれば `time.Duration` がうまい事やってくれるんですが、neovim のだとなんでうまく行かないんだろう。","ts":"1625637870.179600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"83yf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93d99424-4843-494c-b750-e3ad35676ad3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"neovim 詳しくないので誰か教えて欲しいのですが、僕は yaml でしか運用してなくてこの方は neovim の json を使ってるぽいのですが、これってどういう仕組みになってるんでしょう？","ts":"1625637680.177300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jeg5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"febf3a60-fce1-4a8c-8379-9a28f9de8f1c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver/pull/141\u003e","ts":"1625637631.176200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver/pull/141|#141 Add format debounce and improve debounce time setup\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver/pull/141|#141 Add format debounce and improve debounce time setup\u003e","text":"The PR\n\n1. Trying to improve the lintDebounce setup. Currently it only accepts int and it likely to mistake the time unit to ms. The golang Duration unit is ns. That means the setup need to use 500000000 to debounce 500ms. I did a quick grep of setups (dotfiles) in github. Most people are setting this field to 500, I believe they mean to set up debounce to 500ms. The changes allow user setup the debounce to \"500ms\" or \"0.5s\".\n2. Add format debounce. I saw random failures when multiple format tools were configured and will trigger lsp format multiple times. This sometime result in an incorrect result.","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"7","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/efm-langserver|mattn/efm-langserver\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1624258124}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V4m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08886c4b-c5d5-4242-9a41-49870945b00f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"他にセキュリティに抵触するような何かは見当たりませんでした！","ts":"1625642766.206400","thread_ts":"1625642450.204200","parent_user_id":"U03C6TEAZ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AM0y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae2a77e0-aa83-4dd4-a5de-d517b7ca8eaf","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ありがとうございます！","ts":"1625643203.210600","thread_ts":"1625642450.204200","parent_user_id":"U03C6TEAZ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VevA8"}]}]
